# Case: Native cleanup control state and persistence
# Mode: native
# Purpose: Keep cleanup rules inactive when cleanup is off while preserving the independent cache quota.
# Steps:
#   Open real storage settings, verify disabled rules, enable cleanup, disable it again, restart and reopen.
# Expected:
#   Age/count/tag controls follow the cleanup switch; cache quota stays enabled; the saved choice survives restart.
# Forbidden:
#   Active cleanup-rule controls while cleanup is off, lost settings, or claims of native file deletion coverage.

start
submit text 'UNIC-D cleanup settings synthetic'
ui-wait listItem 'UNIC-D cleanup settings synthetic'
ui-click listItem 设置…
ui-wait listItem 存储与备份
ui-click listItem 存储与备份
config-equals history.auto_cleanup false
ui-disabled popUpButton 历史保留时间
ui-disabled popUpButton 最大历史条目数
ui-disabled checkBox '保留 #文本'
ui-enabled popUpButton 单设备缓存配额
screenshot cleanup-off
ui-enabled switch 自动清理历史
ui-click switch 自动清理历史
config-equals history.auto_cleanup true
ui-enabled popUpButton 历史保留时间
ui-enabled popUpButton 最大历史条目数
ui-enabled checkBox '保留 #文本'
ui-enabled switch 自动清理历史
ui-click switch 自动清理历史
config-equals history.auto_cleanup false
restart-desktop
ui-wait listItem 设置…
ui-click listItem 设置…
ui-wait listItem 存储与备份
ui-click listItem 存储与备份
config-equals history.auto_cleanup false
ui-disabled popUpButton 历史保留时间
ui-disabled popUpButton 最大历史条目数
ui-disabled checkBox '保留 #文本'
ui-enabled popUpButton 单设备缓存配额
